Investor's estimate: the market is three times larger than ours by number of vehicles.

What was revealed in five conversations with fleet owners:
— vehicles in the fleet change constantly, drivers work shifts and leave frequently;
— the main pain point is not routes or fuel, but vehicle downtime and shift tracking;
— almost everyone already uses aggregator systems, which are free for the fleet;
— willingness to pay: they quoted 3–8 thousand ₽ per month per fleet, not per vehicle.

The two segment leaders grew through partnerships with aggregators: they were integrated into the fleet's dashboard.

Data requirements: since last year, trip data must be stored within the country; we already comply, but new requirements have emerged regarding the composition of driver data.
